  "schema": "dgtl.hop-catalog.v1",
  "comment": "Wave 9 source of truth for stamp GADS_TOOLS / META_TOOLS / TIKTOK_TOOLS, path templates, methods, and plugin hop GATEWAY_PARAM_ALLOW / CLOSED_HTTPS_FIELDS. Keep byte-identical across dgtl-stamp and dgtl-connector. Plugin Zod schemas stay handwritten per named tool. Describe/recipe tools are plugin-local and MUST NOT appear in tools[]. Adding a named stamp hop: (1) register the MCP tool, (2) add a row here, (3) add a Worker builder, (4) run node scripts/generate-hop-maps.mjs in BOTH repos. Do not add gads_mutate / meta_mutate. Do not delete named tools.",
